<title>JAPAN: Takano to be listed on Tokyo bourse -- TSE.</title>
<headline>Takano to be listed on Tokyo bourse -- TSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Takano Co Ltd will be listed on the second section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) on February 17, the stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>At the time of the listing, Takano will offer 200,000 new shares through a public offering and 50,000 shares through a secondary offering, the TSE said in a statement.</p>
<p>Takano produces office chairs and metal products.</p>
